{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "adaptive_logsoftmax_head_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, in_features]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "head_weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[n_head_classes, in_features]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, n_head_classes]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "计算 head 部分的 log_softmax：out = log_softmax(x @ head_weight.T, dim=1)。",
        "参考 AdaptiveLogSoftmaxWithLoss 中 head 为线性层(无 bias)，后接 log_softmax。",
        "这里 n_head_classes = cutoffs[0] = 5000（因为返回拼接后需与 tail 对齐，但实际 head 输出为 n_head_classes+1=5001，用于后续拼接，本算子输出 5001 列）。",
        "dtype/device 与输入相同，不进行 dtype 提升。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "adaptive_logsoftmax_tail_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, in_features]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "tail_0_weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[hidden_size, in_features]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "tail_1_weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[n_tail_classes, hidden_size]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, n_tail_classes]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "计算 tail 部分的 log_softmax：hidden = x @ tail_0_weight.T；tail_log_probs = log_softmax(hidden @ tail_1_weight.T, dim=1)。",
        "参考 AdaptiveLogSoftmaxWithLoss 中 tail 包含两个线性层(均无 bias)，第二个后接 log_softmax。",
        "hidden_size 由参考模块配置决定（此处为 256），n_tail_classes = n_classes - n_head_classes = 5000。",
        "dtype/device 与输入相同。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "adaptive_logsoftmax_combine",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "head_log_probs",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, n_head_classes]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "tail_log_probs",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, n_tail_classes]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, 1, n_classes]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "将 head_log_probs 和 tail_log_probs 沿最后一维拼接得到 [batch_size, n_classes]，再 unsqueeze(1) 得到 [batch_size, 1, n_classes]。",
        "对应参考语句 torch.cat([head_log_probs, tail_log_probs], dim=1) 后 torch.unsqueeze(..., 1)。",
        "n_head_classes = 5000, n_tail_classes = 5000, n_classes = 10000。",
        "输出形状按任务契约 step_002/step_003 一致。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "log_probs = self.adaptive_logsoftmax.log_prob(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "计算完整的自适应 log-softmax 输出：先 head log-softmax，再 tail log-softmax，然后拼接。",
        "实际返回 shape [batch_size, n_classes]，dtype float32，device cuda。",
        "head 输出 5001 列，tail 输出 5000 列，拼接成 10000 列。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "log_probs = torch.unsqueeze(log_probs, 1)",
      "semantics": [
        "在第 1 维（索引 1）插入大小为 1 的新维度，shape 变为 [batch_size, 1, n_classes]。",
        "不改变数据，stride 变为 [10000, 10000, 1]。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return log_probs",
      "semantics": [
        "返回与 step_002 相同的张量。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}